# Someone comes home, greets and plays with the robot, then leaves.
# Checks: reactions to touch/taps/voice/claps, habituation (repeated
# touching turns into annoyance), orienting to sound, calming down after.
duration 12:00
clock 18:30
sunrise 07:30
sunset 20:30
seed 2
room_light on
window 170 20 40 30
lamp desk 100 12 off

at 1:00 owner home
at 1:05 person alex enter -60 2.0
at 1:10 talk -60 3
at 1:20 person alex walk 0 4
at 1:30 person alex come_close 0.4
at 1:35 pet 1500
at 1:45 tap_screen
at 1:55 double_tap_screen
# the same touch over and over: novelty wears off -> annoyance
every 0:02 from 2:10 until 2:30 touch_head 300
at 3:00 talk 0 4
at 3:20 clap 70
at 3:40 clap -80
at 4:00 triple_tap_screen
at 4:30 shake 1.5
at 5:00 person alex step_back 2.0
at 5:10 person alex walk 120 5
at 5:20 person alex leave
# alone again: should settle, explore, invite play after a while
